# Patterns use **/ so they apply whether the build context is emberly-web
# itself or the parent directory (the documented Coolify context; see
# Dockerfile). For parent-context builds, BuildKit reads the sibling file
# emberly-web/Dockerfile.dockerignore, which mirrors this file.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/.git
**/.github
**/coverage
**/.vercel
**/.DS_Store
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Never ship env files into the image (but keep the checked-in example).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Sibling apps and docs are not part of the web build context.
emberly-resident
docs
